1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:02,090
(Sheldon:)I heard a woman laughing.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,490
(Leonard:)Oh, uh, yeah. I was trying to
see if I could laugh as a woman.

3
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:11,130
Oh! Well, good job.
Quite convincing.

4
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,600
(Sheldon:)I smell perfume.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,670
(Leonard:)Air freshener.

6
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:18,240
(Sheldon:)And is that lipstick
on your cheek and neck?

7
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,570
(Leonard:)Rash. That's a bad rash.

8
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,180
(Sheldon:)My sympathies.

9
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:24,680
I'm no stranger to the crimson
scourge that is dermatitis.

10
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:28,680
(Sheldon:)Can I interest you
in a topical steroid

11
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,650
(Sheldon:)from my lotion and
unguent collection?

12
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:33,660
(Leonard:)Uh, yeah, yeah,
that sounds great.

13
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,820
(Sheldon:)Very well. I'm sure
I can find something

14
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,560
(Sheldon:)that will help
you ditch that itch.

15
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:41,700
(Leonard:)Okay, he's in the
bathroom. Let's go.

16
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,370
(Sheldon:)Do you prefer
ointment or cream?

17
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:50,770
(Sheldon:)Cream.

18
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:52,110
(Sheldon:)With or without a numbing agent?

19
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,110
(Raj:)Without.

20
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:54,510
Really, Leonard?

21
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:57,180
(Sheldon:)There are no heroes when
it comes to dermatitis.

22
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,280
(Leonard:)Fine. With.

23
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:01,120
(Sheldon:)Prescription or
non-prescription strength?

